s":"PENDING","preconditions":[{"basis":[],"equals":"character.fengjie.life_state","reason":"本场前驱是宝玉回家线，未提供凤姐的同步入口记录；历史基线ACTIVE不代替本场已核实存活。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null}],"references":{"knowledge":[],"objects":[],"participants":[{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/7","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/7","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"bca44063796cdc27c5e8076a896ecdbedfbe135109b5461cd9af292e5d0fbaa0","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"chronic_old_illness","household_role":"household_manager","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"MARRIED_JIALIAN"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"fengjie","name":"王熙凤"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/8","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/8","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"18eb0f602b315bef39498961532a6d16a05dbd3cac2e572c07257b6fdf99a63d","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary","household_role":"fengjie_attendant","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"UNRESOLVED"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"ping_er","name":"平儿"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/9","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/9","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"30c29d3a2465ba5aeda93f0359e32a72d1b5424fa9ee01f8cc480d957f3f2ec9","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary_child","household_role":"fengjie_daughter","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"CHILD"},"groups":["jia_household","human","child"],"id":"qiaojie","name":"巧姐"}}]},"required_beats":[{"description":"让读者知道凤姐的病势在宝玉回来前已入末段，承接旧病与劳作而不是被喜讯突然刺激出的新急病。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[33921,34043],"lines":[837,839],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"0296a869f06695cc2bf468405bca8879e9f4c3a803873c67f7decca611c6a32f"},"name":"硬节点","number":1,"text":"**1｜硬节点**  \nR29凤姐短命；当前93为凤死是C级现行排程；R37/R38巧姐线从此转由平儿保护。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"f5987f8a4544b4f1f3ad54a53c6171a89dc2dd1c6b222efb75c3c13cf1fa5e99","value":{"id":"93-S3","title":"凤姐病势在宝玉回来前已进入末段"}}},"id":"93-S3-R1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"空药吊子、药钱、抓药、照料有实际经手难处；医者仅按有限观察作所需判断，不补确定病名/剂量/新病。平儿与巧姐的贴身需要不成为报应判词。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34520,34607],"lines":[849,851],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"bbf552991c41fb791958c2408cc605faeb7a360a78f0e85e97bc015a375c6d57"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34948,35028],"lines":[864,866],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"65a580973cae786f4633de0eed353709abd035ec95c00ad4d68f728844547fc5"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n医者、抓药、白事执行者；丧务比过去简陋。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"f5987f8a4544b4f1f3ad54a53c6171a89dc2dd1c6b222efb75c3c13cf1fa5e99","value":{"id":"93-S3","title":"凤姐病势在宝玉回来前已进入末段"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","pointer":"/resource_flows/12","ref":"data/world/m3_resources.json#/resource_flows/12","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668","text_sha256":"c16e6b0f2139e70eb0fb525488de583b3e9468e1cff0bfc715130360222eeae8","value":{"boundary":"不以大葬恢复排场","chapter":93,"epistemic":"REFERENCE_RESOURCE_FLOW","food_medicine":"日常恢复但钱