OT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"required_objects":[],"revision":"v2","schema_version":1,"status":"AGENT_EDITED","unresolved":["agent_edit_and_semantics: AGENT_EDITED仅表示基于实际v1及绑定包完成当前模型编辑；非人类、非独立盲审、非合资格历史鉴定，正文/同行语义NOT_CHECKED，authority/evidence均NONE。","scene_chronology: 前驱只声明SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY的源列表次序，不证明历史原稿或场内时序。","entry_checkpoint: 后续场无可执行局部入口；不从相邻合同或章末快照注入前场结果。","participants: 医者、抓药者与照料婆子未有实体ID，不能造具名医案权威。","implementation_gap: 空药吊子、药与药钱凭据未注册；不能冒用第86回药碗，死亡时刻与末段医学细目仍未决。","entry_state: character.fengjie.body_state — W90仅有old_illness_worsening_under_labor；未注册临终末段的场级入口，不能从死亡结果反填。","preconditions: character.fengjie.life_state — 本场前驱是宝玉回家线，未提供凤姐的同步入口记录；历史基线ACTIVE不代替本场已核实存活。","exit_state: character.fengjie.body_state — 医者判断、空药吊子与末段照料没有独立状态效果；不把待写病危宣告当作已验证身体值。","parallel_body_scope: 医者/末段判断和宝玉回家相对時点无新事件，原life_state/body_state未知保留。"]},{"authority_effect":"NONE","bindings":{"chapter_plan":{"path":"data/planning/chapters/ch93.json","sha256":"515ed9ce4f4aa83ba37ed0124f4ac31303b4fb375279500a0951cf74019301ce"},"seed":{"path":"data/planning/scenes/93-S4.json","sha256":"d875ac76864928e3968c940719fe0a879a2bf01cc1ddabf5de96c34e9a036731"},"source_packet":{"path":"artifacts/agent_research/phase5/inputs/contract-packet-91-95.json","sha256":"7a044fc4b0b30b9fa3f694714dbe79519af88ff6318819e74a3f38a2e0016816"},"world":{"inputs":[{"path":"data/project/scope.json","sha256":"ecd0c76ea442f5538a3bd5d12f1f3e33d0243318032b5c0446789fb5fdb91dbe"},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733"},{"path":"data/world/m3_locations.json","sha256":"ed1a4053f1459193777f486b3a9743c5aec28afb7d027dee12684da6e3a9d81b"},{"path":"data/world/m3_presence.json","sha256":"7880480b001c321e50056e887f1285f6c7ccf975aed140d1515967ea925bb3bb"},{"path":"data/world/m3_body.json","sha256":"429ca248ea42aa0601e11a55d40fa446da92cee48936627a83b335ab9b18056e"},{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3