citation":{"byte_range":[34637,34717],"lines":[855,857],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"eece0456252fc3d1e6e2c5f896a7d1fa635a40e2adc98b970074aa370d119c14"},"name":"诗文身份","number":7,"text":"**7｜诗文身份**  \nG11凤姐临终诗/忏悔文淘汰；作者挽诗无。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35305,35394],"lines":[873,875],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"158fbb0475de9d26e0e0da1d16bf66bd596fe74f12f70bdec0deb8de8d64eff6"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n凤姐“机关算尽”自我总结、玄奇吐血、恢弘大丧。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}}},"id":"93-S4-F1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"不得以钥匙和旧账恢复她的全府掌控或变出足以治病、厚葬、保亲的大额财产。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35305,35394],"lines":[873,875],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"158fbb0475de9d26e0e0da1d16bf66bd596fe74f12f70bdec0deb8de8d64eff6"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n凤姐“机关算尽”自我总结、玄奇吐血、恢弘大丧。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}}},"id":"93-S4-F2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"function":"以最后一件具体管事维持凤姐的旧能力和身体限度，将旧账钥匙衣物接向平儿的后事及巧姐保护接口。","id":"93-S4","kind":"AGENT_SCENE_CONTRACT","knowledge_binding":null,"knowledge_event_refs":[],"notes":"EDITOR91–95模型只编辑实际v1和绑定源包/章卡/世界引用，未读其他editor提交或reviews。AGENT_EDITED不证明历史事实、正文语义、同行语义PASS、人类或独立盲审资格。participants均PENDING；原entry/pre/exit逐项原样保留，新增状态均UNKNOWN/null且不造basis。源列表只为声明次序；世界/对象/知识绑定不变，不从粗章级接口补场内检查点、知识、身份、人物、物或事件。场别before/after+packet/issues/rationale/unresolved见独占新提交contract-editor-91-95.json；原v1/包/种子/章卡/世界/旧合同字节不变。","object_transition_refs":[],"order":4,"participants":["fengjie","ping_er","qiaojie"],"participants_status":"PENDING","preconditions":[{"basis":[],"equals":"character.fengjie.body_state","reason":"最后管一件事的能力、停顿和疲惫未有独立医学/身体事件。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null}],"references":{"knowledge":[],"objects":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/objects/8","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/objects/8","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"fdbeeb643e1df65b6fb3b739bb6d4f6e4af06230e62859b1d21c9feb33dd0f55","value":{"baseline":{"holder":"fengjie",