落实；涉及巧姐日用只交代有限经手。死后两张纸的买米/药钱用途不提前写成遗产托付已完成，不作宏大遗训。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/transitions/11","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/11","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"c8df689a0658c548757bbfa25ad901e842e343034f7a74ccd8281f2610b80cf4","value":{"action":"HANDOFF","chapter":93,"epistemic":"C_WORLD_INFERENCE","from":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"id":"OT93-01","movement":"OPEN_BOUNDARY","note":"以旧账/钥匙/衣物束承接后事和巧姐保护；不锁具体清单","object_id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","sequence":80,"source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"],"to":{"holder":"ping_er","location":"S06","status":"POSTHUMOUS_PROTECTION_INTERFACE"}}},{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","pointer":"/resource_flows/12","ref":"data/world/m3_resources.json#/resource_flows/12","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668","text_sha256":"c16e6b0f2139e70eb0fb525488de583b3e9468e1cff0bfc715130360222eeae8","value":{"boundary":"不以大葬恢复排场","chapter":93,"epistemic":"REFERENCE_RESOURCE_FLOW","food_medicine":"日常恢复但钱更紧","labor":"平儿转巧姐照料；丧事劳务增加","money_state":"释放不改善家计；凤姐丧事另耗","object_interface":"凤姐旧账/钥匙/衣物","source_ref":"asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"}}]},"id":"93-S4-R1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"巧姐“薄不薄”保留而不先造具体所指物目；旧账钥匙衣物有经手依据才出现，有些钥匙已无柜可开，母女需要与能力限度压住旧管理权。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842]