"}}}]},"id":"93-S4-R3","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"required_objects":["OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE"],"revision":"v2","schema_version":1,"status":"AGENT_EDITED","unresolved":["agent_edit_and_semantics: AGENT_EDITED仅表示基于实际v1及绑定包完成当前模型编辑；非人类、非独立盲审、非合资格历史鉴定，正文/同行语义NOT_CHECKED，authority/evidence均NONE。","scene_chronology: 前驱只声明SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY的源列表次序，不证明历史原稿或场内时序。","entry_checkpoint: 后续场无可执行局部入口；不从相邻合同或章末快照注入前场结果。","implementation_gap: 遗物束只提供功能组，不锁钥匙清单或纸张内容细目；最后具体事项与药钱数额未独立核定。","entry_state: character.fengjie.life_state — 此前末病场无可执行结束检查点；不能从章末死亡事件反定她此刻的生命状态。","entry_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.holder — 遗物束基线仍在凤姐旧府位置，但本场搬后经手和保管范围未核定。","preconditions: character.fengjie.body_state — 最后管一件事的能力、停顿和疲惫未有独立医学/身体事件。","exit_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.status — 两张纸、钥匙与衣物如何交代到平儿尚待落在正文；OT93-01是死后的接口，不能抢作临终场已移交完成。","exit_state: character.fengjie.body_state — 最后一次管事后的身体退出仍无场级状态记录，不以待写动作自证终态。","exit_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.holder — 最后管事不证明遗物束实交平儿；OT93-01是死后OPEN_BOUNDARY推断接口，临终清单/经手未核定。","last_task_not_bequest: 最后一件事待选；两张纸用途、遗物物流及保护执行不前移成全盘托付已完。","participants_scope: 具名角色为待写集合非已验证实际在场，v1的KNOWN集合降为PENDING。"]},{"authority_effect":"NONE","bindings":{"chapter_plan":{"path":"data/planning/chapters/ch93.json","sha256":"515ed9ce4f4aa83ba37ed0124f4ac31303b4fb375279500a0951cf74019301ce"},"seed":{"path":"data/planning/scenes/93-S5.json","sha256":"82e25d33f45f1506429aa327b8d3e0a5e1c2e169d2727933b4ab28d82bd466e3"},"source_packet":{"path":"artifacts/agent_research/phase5/inputs/contract-packet-91-95.json","sha256":"7a044fc4b0b30b9fa3f694714dbe79519af88ff6318819e74a3f38a2e0016816"},"world":{"inputs":[{"path":"data/project/scope.json","sha256":"ecd0c76ea442f5538a3bd5d12f1f3e33d0243318032b5c0446789fb5fdb91dbe"},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733"},{"path":"data/world/m3_locations.json","sha256":"ed1a4053f145919377