tion_cold_sleep_food_hygiene_strain"}}],"equals":"character.baoyu.body_state","status":"KNOWN","value":"detention_cold_sleep_food_hygiene_strain"}],"event_refs":[],"evidence_effect":"NONE","exit_state":[{"basis":[],"equals":"character.baoyu.legal_status","reason":"W93确有RELEASED_NO_RESTORATION，但同时包含凤姐死亡；没有本场独立释放事件，不能整包执行制造早死。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null},{"basis":[],"equals":"character.baoyu.knowledge.baoyu_detention_whole_case","reason":"领物获释不证明宝玉已知全案及最终官面判断，知识接口无此场更新。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null},{"basis":[],"equals":"character.baoyu.location","reason":"离监、领物及实到借院是不同动作；W93同时给回院和凤姐死亡，无本场可单独执行到达检查点。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null}],"forbidden_beats":[{"description":"不得把获释写成全案最终洗清、爵产归还或重金权贵救回；手续不能引发恢弘胜利场。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"33a62fe06ad9520b4eb4b0d4152c7adaf5a56f573882baf94c534b1ff6e9f8b3","value":{"id":"93-S1","title":"释放有手续，不是开门就走"}}},"id":"93-S1-F1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"不得为使释放“有戏”提前执行凤姐死亡，或让喜讯吞没持续病危的另一条线。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"33a62fe06ad9520b4eb4b0d4152c7adaf5a56f573882baf94c534b1ff6e9f8b3","value":{"id":"93-S1","title":"释放有手续，不是开门就走"}}},"id":"93-S1-F2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"W93只是一条混合章级接口，不能此场执行全包效果或私拆“释放子事件”，也不由获释使凤姐此时已死。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[33921,34043],"lines":[837,839],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"0296a869f06695cc2bf468405bca8879e9f4c3a803873c67f7decca611c6a32f"},"name":"硬节点","number":1,"text":"**1｜硬节点**  \nR29凤姐短命；当前93为凤死是C级现行排程；R37/R38巧姐线从此转由平儿保护。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/0","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"33a62fe06ad9520b4eb4b0d4152c7adaf5a56f573882baf94c534b1ff6e9f8b3","value":{"id":"93-S1","title":"释放有手续，不是开门就走"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/events/10","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/events/10","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"d680d4cba780dc6f288c27e8d9c10919b42b5b7d41e9bc211eee23ffe30948fd","value":{"chapter":93,"effects":[{"set":"characters.baoyu.legal_status","value":"RELEASED_NO_REST