人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34948,35028],"lines":[864,866],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"65a580973cae786f4633de0eed353709abd035ec95c00ad4d68f728844547fc5"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n医者、抓药、白事执行者；丧务比过去简陋。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/2","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"f5987f8a4544b4f1f3ad54a53c6171a89dc2dd1c6b222efb75c3c13cf1fa5e99","value":{"id":"93-S3","title":"凤姐病势在宝玉回来前已进入末段"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","pointer":"/resource_flows/12","ref":"data/world/m3_resources.json#/resource_flows/12","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668","text_sha256":"c16e6b0f2139e70eb0fb525488de583b3e9468e1cff0bfc715130360222eeae8","value":{"boundary":"不以大葬恢复排场","chapter":93,"epistemic":"REFERENCE_RESOURCE_FLOW","food_medicine":"日常恢复但钱更紧","labor":"平儿转巧姐照料；丧事劳务增加","money_state":"释放不改善家计；凤姐丧事另耗","object_interface":"凤姐旧账/钥匙/衣物","source_ref":"asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"}}]},"id":"93-S3-R2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"“宝玉回来前已入末段”是双线写作义务，通过先行病势和照料体现；源列表不当同步钟点，不拿W93死亡反造临终检查点。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[33921,34043]