nge":[35305,35394],"lines":[873,875],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"158fbb0475de9d26e0e0da1d16bf66bd596fe74f12f70bdec0deb8de8d64eff6"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n凤姐“机关算尽”自我总结、玄奇吐血、恢弘大丧。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}}},"id":"93-S4-F1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"不得以钥匙和旧账恢复她的全府掌控或变出足以治病、厚葬、保亲的大额财产。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35305,35394],"lines":[873,875],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"158fbb0475de9d26e0e0da1d16bf66bd596fe74f12f70bdec0deb8de8d64eff6"},"name":"应删","number":13,"text":"**13｜应删**  \n凤姐“机关算尽”自我总结、玄奇吐血、恢弘大丧。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}}},"id":"93-S4-F2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"function":"以最后一件具体管事维持凤姐的旧能力和身体限度，将旧账钥匙衣物接向平儿的后事及巧姐保护接口。","id":"93-S4","kind":"AGENT_SCENE_CONTRACT","knowledge_binding":null,"knowledge_event_refs":[],"notes":"EDITOR91–95模型只编辑实际v1和绑定源包/章卡/世界引用，未读其他editor提交或reviews。AGENT_EDITED不证明历史事实、正文语义、同行语义PASS、人类或独立盲审资格。participants均PENDING；原entry/pre/exit逐项原样保留，新增状态均UNKNOWN/null且不造basis。源列表只为声明次序；世界/对象/知识绑定不变，不从粗章级接口补场内检查点、知识、身份、人物、物或事件。场别before/after+packet/issues/rationale/unresolved见独占新提交contract-editor-91-95.json；原v1/包/种子/章卡/世界/旧合同字节不变。","object_transition_refs":[],"order":4,"participants":["fengjie","ping_er","qiaojie"],"participants_status":"PENDING","preconditions":[{"basis":[],"equals":"character.fengjie.body_state","reason":"最后管一件事的能力、停顿和疲惫未有独立医学/身体事件。","status":"UNKNOWN","value":null}],"references":{"knowledge":[],"objects":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/objects/8","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/objects/8","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"fdbeeb643e1df65b6fb3b739bb6d4f6e4af06230e62859b1d21c9feb33dd0f55","value":{"baseline":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"continuity_rules":["只表示旧账/钥匙/衣物作为后事接口，不锁具体钥匙清单"],"evidence_status":"REFERENCE_WORLD_INFERENCE","id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","identity_status":"C_WORLD_OBJECT_GROUP","kind":"household_control_bundle","name":"凤姐旧账钥匙衣物束","source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"]}}],"participants":[{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/7","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/7","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"bca44063796cdc27c5e8076a896ecdbedfbe135109b5461cd9af292e5d0fbaa0","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"chronic_old_illness","household_role":"household_manager","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"MARRIED_JIALIAN"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"fengjie","name":"王熙凤"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/8","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/8","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"18eb0f602b315bef39498961532a6d16a05dbd3cac2e572c07257b6fdf99a63d","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary","household_role":"fengjie_attendant","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"UNRESOLVED"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"ping_er","name":"平儿"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/9","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/9","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"30c29d3a2465ba5aeda93f0359e32a72d1b5424fa9ee01f8cc480d957f3f2ec9","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary_child","household_role":"fengjie_daughter","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"CHILD"},"groups":["jia_household","human","child"],"id":"qiaojie","name":"巧姐"}}]},"required_beats":[{"description":"凤姐最后只管一件当下能办的小事，具体事项待落实；涉及巧姐日用只交代有限经手。死后两张纸的买米/药钱用途不提前写成遗产托付已完成，不作宏大遗训。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/transitions/11","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/11","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"c8df689a0658c548757bbfa25ad901e842e343034f7a74ccd8281f2610b80cf4","value":{"action":"HANDOFF","chapter":93,"epistemic":"C_WORLD_INFERENCE","from":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"id":"OT93-01","movement":"OPEN_BOUNDARY","note":"以旧账/钥匙/衣物束承接后事和巧姐保护；不锁具体清单","object_id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","sequence":80,"source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"],"to":{"holder":"ping_er","location":"S06","status":"POSTHUMOUS_PROTECTION_INTERFACE"}}},{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","pointer":"/resource_flows/12","ref":"data/world/m3_resources.json#/resource_flows/12","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668","text_sha256":"c16e6b0f2139e70eb0fb525488de583b3e9468e1cff0bfc715130360222eeae8","value":{"boundary":"不以大葬恢复排场","chapter":93,"epistemic":"REFERENCE_RESOURCE_FLOW","food_medicine":"日常恢复但钱更紧","labor":"平儿转巧姐照料；丧事劳务增加","money_state":"释放不改善家计；凤姐丧事另耗","object_interface":"凤姐旧账/钥匙/衣物","source_ref":"asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"}}]},"id":"93-S4-R1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"巧姐“薄不薄”保留而不先造具体所指物目；旧账钥匙衣物有经手依据才出现，有些钥匙已无柜可开，母女需要与能力限度压住旧管理权。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34520,34607],"lines":[849,851],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"bbf552991c41fb791958c2408cc605faeb7a360a78f0e85e97bc015a375c6d57"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/transitions/11","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/11","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"c8df689a0658c548757bbfa25ad901e842e343034f7a74ccd8281f2610b80cf4","value":{"action":"HANDOFF","chapter":93,"epistemic":"C_WORLD_INFERENCE","from":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"id":"OT93-01","movement":"OPEN_BOUNDARY","note":"以旧账/钥匙/衣物束承接后事和巧姐保护；不锁具体清单","object_id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","sequence":80,"source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"],"to":{"holder":"ping_er","location":"S06","status":"POSTHUMOUS_PROTECTION_INTERFACE"}}}]},"id":"93-S4-R2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"遗物束从S02接死后S06仍为OPEN_BOUNDARY；不假装已有旧府取回、床边摆放或临终移交完成的场级物流。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/3","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"7fba918e5e337880e9880a163ec5c702930e6e47c43f2b407dc04d36a3322d27","value":{"id":"93-S4","title":"凤姐最后一次“管事”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/transitions/11","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/11","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"c8df689a0658c548757bbfa25ad901e842e343034f7a74ccd8281f2610b80cf4","value":{"action":"HANDOFF","chapter":93,"epistemic":"C_WORLD_INFERENCE","from":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"id":"OT93-01","movement":"OPEN_BOUNDARY","note":"以旧账/钥匙/衣物束承接后事和巧姐保护；不锁具体清单","object_id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","sequence":80,"source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"],"to":{"holder":"ping_er","location":"S06","status":"POSTHUMOUS_PROTECTION_INTERFACE"}}}]},"id":"93-S4-R3","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"required_objects":["OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE"],"revision":"v2","schema_version":1,"status":"AGENT_EDITED","unresolved":["agent_edit_and_semantics: AGENT_EDITED仅表示基于实际v1及绑定包完成当前模型编辑；非人类、非独立盲审、非合资格历史鉴定，正文/同行语义NOT_CHECKED，authority/evidence均NONE。","scene_chronology: 前驱只声明SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY的源列表次序，不证明历史原稿或场内时序。","entry_checkpoint: 后续场无可执行局部入口；不从相邻合同或章末快照注入前场结果。","implementation_gap: 遗物束只提供功能组，不锁钥匙清单或纸张内容细目；最后具体事项与药钱数额未独立核定。","entry_state: character.fengjie.life_state — 此前末病场无可执行结束检查点；不能从章末死亡事件反定她此刻的生命状态。","entry_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.holder — 遗物束基线仍在凤姐旧府位置，但本场搬后经手和保管范围未核定。","preconditions: character.fengjie.body_state — 最后管一件事的能力、停顿和疲惫未有独立医学/身体事件。","exit_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.status — 两张纸、钥匙与衣物如何交代到平儿尚待落在正文；OT93-01是死后的接口，不能抢作临终场已移交完成。","exit_state: character.fengjie.body_state — 最后一次管事后的身体退出仍无场级状态记录，不以待写动作自证终态。","exit_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.holder — 最后管事不证明遗物束实交平儿；OT93-01是死后OPEN_BOUNDARY推断接口，临终清单/经手未核定。","last_task_not_bequest: 最后一件事待选；两张纸用途、遗物物流及保护执行不前移成全盘托付已完。","participants_scope: 具名角色为待写集合非已验证实际在场，v1的KNOWN集合降为PENDING。"]},"data/planning/contracts/agent-final-v1/93-S5.v2.json":{"authority_effect":"NONE","bindings":{"chapter_plan":{"path":"data/planning/chapters/ch93.json","sha256":"515ed9ce4f4aa83ba37ed0124f4ac31303b4fb375279500a0951cf74019301ce"},"seed":{"path":"data/planning/scenes/93-S5.json","sha256":"82e25d33f45f1506429aa327b8d3e0a5e1c2e169d2727933b4ab28d82bd466e3"},"source_packet":{"path":"artifacts/agent_research/phase5/inputs/contract-packet-91-95.json","sha256":"7a044fc4b0b30b9fa3f694714dbe79519af88ff6318819e74a3f38a2e0016816"},"world":{"inputs":[{"path":"data/project/scope.json","sha256":"ecd0c76ea442f5538a3bd5d12f1f3e33d0243318032b5c0446789fb5fdb91dbe"},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733"},{"path":"data/world/m3_locations.json","sha256":"ed1a4053f1459193777f486b3a9743c5aec28afb7d027dee12684da6e3a9d81b"},{"path":"data/world/m3_presence.json","sha256":"7880480b001c321e50056e887f1285f6c7ccf975aed140d1515967ea925bb3bb"},{"path":"data/world/m3_body.json","sha256":"429ca248ea42aa0601e11a55d40fa446da92cee48936627a83b335ab9b18056e"},{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","sha256":"b823f