atus":"REFERENCE_WORLD_INFERENCE","id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","identity_status":"C_WORLD_OBJECT_GROUP","kind":"household_control_bundle","name":"凤姐旧账钥匙衣物束","source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"]}}],"participants":[{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/7","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/7","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"bca44063796cdc27c5e8076a896ecdbedfbe135109b5461cd9af292e5d0fbaa0","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"chronic_old_illness","household_role":"household_manager","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"MARRIED_JIALIAN"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"fengjie","name":"王熙凤"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/8","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/8","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"18eb0f602b315bef39498961532a6d16a05dbd3cac2e572c07257b6fdf99a63d","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary","household_role":"fengjie_attendant","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"UNRESOLVED"},"groups":["jia_household","human"],"id":"ping_er","name":"平儿"}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/characters/9","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/characters/9","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"30c29d3a2465ba5aeda93f0359e32a72d1b5424fa9ee01f8cc480d957f3f2ec9","value":{"baseline":{"body_state":"ordinary_child","household_role":"fengjie_daughter","legal_status":"NOT_AT_ISSUE","life_state":"ACTIVE","location":"S02","marital_status":"CHILD"},"groups":["jia_household","human","child"],"id":"qiaojie","name":"巧姐"}}]},"required_beats":[{"description":"凤姐死后首先问谁来主丧，丧务比过去简陋；反写她过去主持他人丧礼而自己的丧事无人可找她。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34948,35028],"lines":[864,866],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"65a580973cae786f4633de0eed353709abd035ec95c00ad4d68f728844547fc5"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n医者、抓药、白事执行者；丧务比过去简陋。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35445,35563],"lines":[879,881],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"a3f050b8e1f75ff0e201fe5105312169d4f8bb57508df29c5f98acf4aa9a7e39"},"name":"前80同构","number":15,"text":"**15｜前80同构**  \n凤姐过去主持他人丧礼；本回用“她自己的丧事没有凤姐可找”反打。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"a769c219a5511f87b88550b575a54595cbd3f5971f445ee8f537f6e2fe4f5dae","value":{"id":"93-S5","title":"死后首先出现的是“谁来主丧”"}}},"id":"93-S5-R1","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"保留白布短一截、买米与巧姐药钱仍需料理；平儿本要陪巧姐，却又起身去办现实缺口。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34043,34225],"lines":[840,842],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"efa37f4b209fe5a191064f129e6a0b8ee8b28df41dedd5cf00f176dc9873bc75"},"name":"最强处","number":2,"text":"**2｜最强处**  \n宝玉回家第一件事是热饭、洗手、换衣；凤姐死后两张纸仍是买米/巧姐药钱；钥匙有些已无柜可开；平儿被叫去补白布。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35195,35305],"lines":[870,872],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"83d1dcf9f335e7fa03c6553c1d6649d486aea624c3973611c3d120a4f5894663"},"name":"必须保留","number":12,"text":"**12｜必须保留**  \n热粥、巧姐问薄不薄、空药吊子、白布短一截、平儿起身去办。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"a769c219a5511f87b88550b575a54595cbd3f5971f445ee8f537f6e2fe4f5dae","value":{"id":"93-S5","title":"死后首先出现的是“谁来主丧”"}}},"id":"93-S5-R2","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"死亡以后才接遗物实际后事经手及巧姐保护需要；平儿有看得到的接手/被叫走动作。OT93-01为推断级接口，不锁清单、法定监护或所有旧物已归平儿。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[33921,34043],"lines":[837,839],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"0296a869f06695cc2bf468405bca8879e9f4c3a803873c67f7decca611c6a32f"},"name":"硬节点","number":1,"text":"**1｜硬节点**  \nR29凤姐短命；当前93为凤死是C级现行排程；R37/R38巧姐线从此转由平儿保护。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34520,34607],"lines":[849,851],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"bbf552991c41fb791958c2408cc605faeb7a360a78f0e85e97bc015a375c6d57"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"a769c219a5511f87b88550b575a54595cbd3f5971f445ee8f537f6e2fe4f5dae","value":{"id":"93-S5","title":"死后首先出现的是“谁来主丧”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/objects/m4.json","pointer":"/transitions/11","ref":"data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/11","sha256":"5c2719605b0d2b78d3c06d6bb7444c5c5058fd3891879f8dcfa480cd1828b4db","text_sha256":"c8df689a0658c548757bbfa25ad901e842e343034f7a74ccd8281f2610b80cf4","value":{"action":"HANDOFF","chapter":93,"epistemic":"C_WORLD_INFERENCE","from":{"holder":"fengjie","location":"S02","status":"HOUSEHOLD_CONTROL_ITEMS"},"id":"OT93-01","movement":"OPEN_BOUNDARY","note":"以旧账/钥匙/衣物束承接后事和巧姐保护；不锁具体清单","object_id":"OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE","sequence":80,"source_refs":["asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"],"to":{"holder":"ping_er","location":"S06","status":"POSTHUMOUS_PROTECTION_INTERFACE"}}},{"path":"data/world/m3_core.json","pointer":"/events/10","ref":"data/world/m3_core.json#/events/10","sha256":"c4bf1c75fda8994fd846e570a64ae69efeb6ca17cd27e78c1bb1af4d7783d733","text_sha256":"d680d4cba780dc6f288c27e8d9c10919b42b5b7d41e9bc211eee23ffe30948fd","value":{"chapter":93,"effects":[{"set":"characters.baoyu.legal_status","value":"RELEASED_NO_RESTORATION"},{"set":"characters.baoyu.location","value":"S06"},{"set":"characters.baoyu.body_state","value":"post_detention_recovery"},{"set":"characters.fengjie.life_state","value":"DEAD"},{"set":"characters.fengjie.body_state","value":"DEAD_AFTER_CHRONIC_DECLINE"},{"set":"relations.rel:fengjie_ping.status","value":"ENDED_BY_DEATH"},{"set":"relations.rel:fengjie_qiaojie.status","value":"ENDED_BY_DEATH"},{"set":"characters.ping_er.household_role","value":"qiaojie_protection_executor"}],"epistemic":"CURRENT_C_WORLD","id":"W93-RELEASE-FENGJIE-DEATH","sequence":70,"source_refs":["R29"]}}]},"id":"93-S5-R3","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"},{"description":"“谁来主丧”先是组织缺口，再落实谁决定、谁跑白事、谁照看巧姐；未注册执行者和白布/灯/棺只留义务，不让平儿一人自动填满职能。","grounding":{"chapter_card_fields":[{"citation":{"byte_range":[34225,34340],"lines":[843,845],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"d260746d432ea4ea17f3e8ce6844e215bca76547ca9f02df20e9306c25c6f783"},"name":"最薄处","number":3,"text":"**3｜最薄处**  \n释放手续、凤姐死前“最后一件管事”、死后“谁来主丧”可以更清。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34340,34520],"lines":[846,848],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"24c75446bbadf3e0a5a544feaa3b251e5f41cf772e5918e4ce448363682d12ea"},"name":"缺失情节","number":4,"text":"**4｜缺失情节**  \n93-S1领取随身物/仍可传问；S2回家先吃；S3凤姐在宝玉回来前已末段；S4最后只管一件事；S5她一死立刻出现组织真空。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34520,34607],"lines":[849,851],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"bbf552991c41fb791958c2408cc605faeb7a360a78f0e85e97bc015a375c6d57"},"name":"人物","number":5,"text":"**5｜人物**  \n宝玉/宝钗/麝月A线；凤姐/平儿/巧姐/医者/婆子B线。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[34948,35028],"lines":[864,866],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"65a580973cae786f4633de0eed353709abd035ec95c00ad4d68f728844547fc5"},"name":"职业","number":10,"text":"**10｜职业**  \n医者、抓药、白事执行者；丧务比过去简陋。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35028,35195],"lines":[867,869],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"2369b960bd77349ce3570b4f2bfdac3cb767cd2a7937d9803939fb138c0e688b"},"name":"四链","number":11,"text":"**11｜四链**  \nE2：宝玉获释不带来钱，凤死立刻要钱。物链从热饭/水转到白布/灯/棺/遗物；信息上释放小喜立即被病危压过。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35445,35563],"lines":[879,881],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"a3f050b8e1f75ff0e201fe5105312169d4f8bb57508df29c5f98acf4aa9a7e39"},"name":"前80同构","number":15,"text":"**15｜前80同构**  \n凤姐过去主持他人丧礼；本回用“她自己的丧事没有凤姐可找”反打。\n\n"},{"citation":{"byte_range":[35618,35900],"lines":[885,888],"path":"sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md","sha256":"cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c","text_sha256":"b024aef7267d8e0f55de72f25a39d4a76cd408f26c09300906dd304dd185b6b3"},"name":"章法 / 风险","number":18,"text":"**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n释放 → 回家吃热饭 → 看凤姐 → 最后一件具体管事 → 身体退出 → 死 → 丧务组织真空 → 平儿留下陪巧姐又被现实叫走。  \n**风险：**死亡压过宝玉获释或反之；需保持“双恢复/双退出”。\n\n"}],"seed":{"path":"data/prewrite/v06.json","pointer":"/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","ref":"data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/12/candidate_scenes/4","sha256":"caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff","text_sha256":"a769c219a5511f87b88550b575a54595cbd3f5971f445ee8f537f6e2fe4f5dae","value":{"id":"93-S5","title":"死后首先出现的是“谁来主丧”"}},"world_records":[{"path":"data/world/m3_resources.json","pointer":"/resource_flows/12","ref":"data/world/m3_resources.json#/resource_flows/12","sha256":"b823f72594d4a2af2216525cbfd3411b00d41c4ad0fa89830348933be6de7668","text_sha256":"c16e6b0f2139e70eb0fb525488de583b3e9468e1cff0bfc715130360222eeae8","value":{"boundary":"不以大葬恢复排场","chapter":93,"epistemic":"REFERENCE_RESOURCE_FLOW","food_medicine":"日常恢复但钱更紧","labor":"平儿转巧姐照料；丧事劳务增加","money_state":"释放不改善家计；凤姐丧事另耗","object_interface":"凤姐旧账/钥匙/衣物","source_ref":"asset:sha256:ffed02aee8809a8937651529048e2cc10256a0ae2e2706251c9b806a6ea6ef50"}}]},"id":"93-S5-R4","scope":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT","status":"PENDING"}],"required_objects":["OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE"],"revision":"v2","schema_version":1,"status":"AGENT_EDITED","unresolved":["agent_edit_and_semantics: AGENT_EDITED仅表示基于实际v1及绑定包完成当前模型编辑；非人类、非独立盲审、非合资格历史鉴定，正文/同行语义NOT_CHECKED，authority/evidence均NONE。","scene_chronology: 前驱只声明SOURCE_LIST_ORDER_NOT_VERIFIED_CHRONOLOGY的源列表次序，不证明历史原稿或场内时序。","entry_checkpoint: 后续场无可执行局部入口；不从相邻合同或章末快照注入前场结果。","participants: 主丧决策人与白事执行者未有注册ID，不能用无名凤姐替身自动完成组织缺口。","implementation_gap: W93是释放/死亡合并事件，只作涉及死亡与保护的章级接口，不在本场重演宝玉释放。","implementation_gap: 白布、灯、棺和经办钱未有对象ID；遗物束由S02至S06为OPEN_BOUNDARY，不锁补造具体旧府运送史。","entry_state: character.fengjie.life_state — 前场最后管事未有经核定的结束检查点，不能自动推出本场已死或未死的时刻。","preconditions: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.status — 遗物束从临终交代到死后经手的具体状态未有局部桥。","exit_state: character.fengjie.life_state — W93确有死亡效果，但该章级混合事件同时包含更早的释放，不能据此宣称本场死亡时刻已验证。","exit_state: character.ping_er.household_role — W93的qiaojie_protection_executor是当前章级角色接口；平儿实际承接保护与丧务尚待场级核定。","exit_state: object.OBJ-FENGJIE-LEGACY-BUNDLE.holder — OT93-01将后事接口交平儿，但移交物目、地点与时间的场内映射仍未核定。","registered_event_placement: 已引用的世界/物件事件仅为义务涉及的现行章级接口，不证明这些事件在此种子场逐项执行；局部条件保持UNKNOWN。","death_body_casting: fengjie为死亡身体/遗事焦点非死后活体角色；W93/OT93仍粗粒度涉及接口。"]},"data/project/plan_constraints_v1.json":{"authority":"CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_ONLY","baseline":{"release_id":"release:stable:v1.4","text_sha256":"4645da79b1bed76f54be281c50b5df648f599ea41541fb7855685753b6a85320"},"id":"plan-constraints:imported:v1","provenance":{"kind":"EXISTING_BASELINE_MIGRATION","note":"2026-10-08 将现行运行校验中的方案选择迁为版本约束；继承当前保护，不产生新的文学裁决、采用或发布。"},"rules":{"literary_ecology":[{"basis_refs":["asset:sha256:c974385eeaa02e7b1a6170cb702aae2bed84eab96e5ba13f5e68968d5f1700c2"],"equals":"无字胜出","id":"farewell-choice","path":["g_layer","G07","decision"]},{"basis_refs":["asset:sha256:fc421b406baee7946b3d3bf4291c59678bfb09a04d13939c9e80199f157e7674"],"equals":"B_PRESERVE_EXISTING","id":"rhyme-exception","path":["author_rhyme",92,"winner"]},{"basis_refs":["asset:sha256:fc421b406baee7946b3d3bf42